{"id": "p001-004", "text": "ravi got made redundant from the bank last wk, whole team gone. he's weirdly relieved?? thinking about retraning as a teacher", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last wk", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about retraning as a teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "p001-010", "text": "rang caitlin back. her nan had a fall sat night, she's in hospital up in inverness. caitlin's gone up to stay w/ her mum. need to check in w/ her sun eve", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sun eve", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "p001-012", "text": "long call w/ natasha popescu. her husband florin's whole dept is being made redundant end of november, she's reallly worried w/ the kids being so little. florin has a consultation mtg monday at 10 and he's already looking at jobs in leeds but she doesn't want to move the kids schools. i should send her that recruiter contact and ask around at work if theres anything going for him", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "natasha popescu", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "florin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of november", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "florin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "consultation mtg", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "monday at 10", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking at jobs in leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that recruiter contact", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask around at work if theres anything going for him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "p001-015", "text": "school gate chat w/ lindiwe and kiri. lindiwe's son sits his 11 plus on the 14th at 9, she's more nervous than he is lol. kiri's daughter mila got into the national youth choir!! first rehearsal is 9 january 2027 in bham and kiri's already organising a lift share for it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kiri", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "11 plus", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kiri", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "mila", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the national youth choir", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first rehearsal", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 january 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kiri", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "p001-017", "text": "so apparantly ebony dumped samir?? she told me at work, said he never makes any effort. she's fine actually, more annoyed than sad. samir's moving out of their flat on the 1st and staying w/ his cousin in croydon til he finds somewhere. ebony reckons she'll do the camino next spring to clear her head", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dumped", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "more annoyed than sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "camino", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring", "anchor": "e3"}]}
